{"id":"krone","lemma":"Krone","pos":"noun","rank":2434,"glosses":["crown","crown (the name of various currencies)","head (of beer or other carbonated beverages)"],"ipa":"/ˈkʁoːnə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/De-Krone.ogg/De-Krone.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Krone","plural":"Kronen"},"formAudio":{"Kronen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Kronen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich sehe eine Krone.","en":"I see a crown.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745533","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Hier gibt es eine Krone.","en":"There's a crown here.","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Der König trägt immer eine Krone.","en":"The king always wears a crown.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"king"},{"g":"to carry, to bear","l":"tragen"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Die Krone der Königin war aus Gold.","en":"The Queen's crown was made of gold.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"queen"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"gold"}]},{"text":"Der König hat immer eine Krone auf.","en":"The king always wears a crown.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"king"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"on"}]}]}